{"id":"20e88b72affa35d1","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-effective-join.md","title":"Effective Join","display":"df-effective-join — Effective Join","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-effective-join","aliases":["88-df-effective-join"],"display":"df-effective-join — Effective Join","depends_on":["[[88-df-encoding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-effective-join"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-effective-join</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-effective-join — Effective Join"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\">\\(a:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\)</span> 为任意集合序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=a(k)\">\\(A_k=a(k)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{enc}\">\\(\\mathrm{enc}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a> 中已唯一确定的定义性编码函数；此处使用其长度为二的元组码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigoplus_{k\\in\\mathbb N}A_k\">\\(\\bigoplus_{k\\in\\mathbb N}A_k\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\oplus B\">\\(A\\oplus B\\)</span> 是本文件定义的有效直和记号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}join}\\vdash\n\\forall a:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\quad\n\\bigoplus_{k\\in\\mathbb N}a(k)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{enc}(k,x):k,x\\in\\mathbb N\\land x\\in a(k)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}join}\\vdash\n\\forall a:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\quad\n\\bigoplus_{k\\in\\mathbb N}a(k)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{enc}(k,x):k,x\\in\\mathbb N\\land x\\in a(k)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}join}\\vdash\n\\forall A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\quad\nA\\oplus B\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{enc}(0,x):x\\in A\\}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{enc}(1,x):x\\in B\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}join}\\vdash\n\\forall A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\quad\nA\\oplus B\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{enc}(0,x):x\\in A\\}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{enc}(1,x):x\\in B\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}join}\\vdash\n\\forall a:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\;\\forall k,x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\left(\\mathrm{enc}(k,x)\\in\\bigoplus_{j\\in\\mathbb N}a(j)\n\\leftrightarrow x\\in a(k)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}join}\\vdash\n\\forall a:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\;\\forall k,x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\left(\\mathrm{enc}(k,x)\\in\\bigoplus_{j\\in\\mathbb N}a(j)\n\\leftrightarrow x\\in a(k)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里“有效”修饰列的编码与统一读取方式，并不假定每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k\">\\(A_k\\)</span> 或整个序列可计算。非法配对码以及未使用的列码不在相应直和内；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{enc}\">\\(\\mathrm{enc}\\)</span> 只需有可判定像及有效解码，不必满射到全部自然数。</p>\n<p>直和是自然数的一个子集，而非集合序列本身，也不同于普通并集：列号必须保留。后续使用该算子的文件应同时在元数据和假设中引用本文件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{enc}$ 是 [[88-df-encoding]] 中已唯一确定的定义性编码函数；此处使用其长度为二的元组码。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"a:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)","display":false},{"tex":"A_k=a(k)","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{enc}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigoplus_{k\\in\\mathbb N}A_k","display":false},{"tex":"A\\oplus B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}join}\\vdash\n\\forall a:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\quad\n\\bigoplus_{k\\in\\mathbb N}a(k)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{enc}(k,x):k,x\\in\\mathbb N\\land x\\in a(k)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}join}\\vdash\n\\forall A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\quad\nA\\oplus B\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{enc}(0,x):x\\in A\\}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{enc}(1,x):x\\in B\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}join}\\vdash\n\\forall a:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\;\\forall k,x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\left(\\mathrm{enc}(k,x)\\in\\bigoplus_{j\\in\\mathbb N}a(j)\n\\leftrightarrow x\\in a(k)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"A_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{enc}","display":false}],"bytes":1652,"backlinks":[{"id":"6587ae27f7ed289f","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\bigoplus_{k\\in\\mathbb N}A_k$ 是 [[88-df-effective-join]] 中用固定编码定义的有效直和，不能解释成普通并集。"},{"id":"5e3111fd9385df4f","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$J$ 见 [[88-df-jump-operator-def]]；$\\bigoplus$ 见 [[88-df-effective-join]]。"},{"id":"32064e6d9e6f371a","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"有限损伤运行与验证义务分别见 [[88-df-priority-method]]、[[88-lem-finite-injury-verification]]；合并双输出时使用 [[88-df-effective-join]] 的 $A\\oplus B$。"},{"id":"0d1300ef33ffd8df","anchor":"ref-79","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\bigoplus$ 与 $\\oplus$ 导入 [[88-df-effective-join]]；$W_e,W_{e,s}$ 导入 [[88-df-ce-indexing]]；$F_e$ 导入 [[88-df-oracle-rules]]。"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-ackermann-function.md]]\n[[88-df-alphabet.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-delta.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-pi.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-sigma.md]]\n[[88-df-assignment.md]]\n[[88-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-axiom.md]]\n[[88-df-bijective.md]]\n[[88-df-bound-variable.md]]\n[[88-df-bounded-quantifier.md]]\n[[88-df-canonical-model.md]]\n[[88-df-cardinality.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-indexing.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[88-df-church-turing-thesis.md]]\n[[88-df-classical-calculus.md]]\n[[88-df-closed-term.md]]\n[[88-df-compactness.md]]\n[[88-df-completeness.md]]\n[[88-df-computable-function.md]]\n[[88-df-consistent.md]]\n[[88-df-countable.md]]\n[[88-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[88-df-decidable-set.md]]\n[[88-df-defined.md]]\n[[88-df-delta0-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-delta1-set.md]]\n[[88-df-derivation.md]]\n[[88-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[88-df-effective-join.md]]\n[[88-df-effective-program-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-elementary-equivalence.md]]\n[[88-df-elementary-substructure.md]]\n[[88-df-encoding.md]]\n[